      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY ARNOLD (3) was a (29.67) winner last time out at this track from Box 3. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from three starts. Looks the one to beat. ABSCONDING (4) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 29.66. Has a tricky draw to overcome but likes the trip. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Leading player again. REIGN PLANE (7) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (29.92) at this track in a NG over 520m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Well-placed to take this out. SCRUTINISING (5) must be among the chances on the last run here.",
